# SOLARIS CET — Agent Memory & Loops

## Before any task (Loop 0 — Memory)
```bash
npm run stash:prime -- <topic>
```
Then read hits + `docs/planning/agent-memory.md` + `docs/planning/grok.md`.
Ask: *Has a prior agent tried this? What failed?*

## After every task (Loop 7 — Retrospective)
```bash
npm run stash:sync
npm run stash:verify   # optional — full Stash + smoke check
```

## Self-sufficient (from Fergana Stash)
- Run commands yourself — never tell the user to run what you can run.
- Check logs, ports, HTTP status yourself.
- Kill/restart **only** PIDs/ports for this worktree (`dev:local`, not blind `pkill`).
- Verify UI with HTTP smoke or Playwright — don't ask user to "test in browser".

## Local dev (one command)
```bash
npm run dev:local
```
Survey UI: http://localhost:5173/survey

